ess $f(x)$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={e}^{u},\\,u={x}^{5}+1.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}={e}^{u},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5{x}^{4}.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & ={e}^{u}\\cdot (5{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =5{x}^{4}{e}^{u} \\\\  & =5{x}^{4}{e}^{{x}^{5}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-107437/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "107eaf98-be8c-5fb1-ac4c-948b1e00df0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107437"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107445/selection/cc1c9217e77b40a6f03d9d7fc4f50dfdc6f81234ba18c60fd9664bb185c7c2dc" :answer/id #uuid "280a36ef-74b5-5ef4-a77f-a410cb1ddc10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}{e}^{{x}^{2}-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107445/selection/60fab4957d0d2f4c9fa008ed210d9d870ca525051ad52e1bb57cd9fe4d070ff0" :answer/id #uuid "e1e94af8-91ca-5b0c-b6d7-ac4b719d834c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2x+2){e}^{{x}^{2}-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107445/selection/30ed8dd8798c5d529aa7888e9ed50b35b4a9f306ecf8fa2214ff781ec8c587bb" :answer/id #uuid "fb162794-e5a5-5cda-9c2a-432d8f3ffe85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2x-2){e}^{{x}^{2}-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107445/selection/72ce7eb8fe098976de687082ec72f079b27c70b0715ee5f194e0ce5e14bf4f0e" :answer/id #uuid "6e84af23-2ad0-570c-8519-795951156b48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x{e}^{{x}^{2}-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107445/selection/80dcd7b2b4e46c778845127cb8ec8805ed6b0f8a252e2ea02537bfb58265f0c4" :answer/id #uuid "58cb1f2e-f0a4-5131-acef-9a97dedf3ea3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{e}^{{x}^{2}-2x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} 